    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3033fdeabd4bcdb837210a47",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ナリタトップロードはいつだって\n周囲を照らしてきた。これこそ彼女と共に\n歩んできた道程――光の道だった。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a34949a8347bed4f70d2f0eb41950e252350982f7b9a6ba40caf107546ce82f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef86f650e7552e1a217f1458",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "初めは小さかった光が、みんなを眩しく\n照らすほど輝き、頂への道を駆ける！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8f5a34f821c91bda322a73b2af39cee8df772db6167b70e9d6fdf9db69af01b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8f38b572d851c5908d1aab3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有馬記念にむけて",
      "source_fingerprint": "8429185b017460c9e109c917019789b964cc7937ccf7c516c2e966930dd6ab91",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
