    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1402cf3110f760fab22c31db",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "次走は、『皐月賞』……まだクラシック級で\n未完成な彼女をどう導くか――トレーナー\nとしての責任が、部屋の空気を重くした。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fb15af82cb6c07530f77264d1fa5493149ba186154e08155a71346d182d9ad8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa27e103633d7f5e421e394e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "弥生賞の後に・光と闇の出逢い",
      "source_fingerprint": "7524ac81028c1f2dab9da1627eca1a3531694bbbae17ad1591cedf6b504f6628",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
